The figures are drawn by a diagram program, so each arrow starts on one shape and ends on the next. They can be rebuilt with the report. The text in each box is the name of a page or a file in this project, not a general template. If a box says exam, the website has an exam page. If a box says UCI CSV, the file is data/uci_student_performance.csv.

H2 4.13 Walk from the context diagram to a click
