Fig. 4.6 is only the exam, so it does not show the SVM. The SVM path is the predict form, which I described in section 4.6 in words because one sequence diagram was enough for the chapter. The activity in Fig. 4.7 splits on the role after the password check. A student branch ends at the exam or the prediction. A teacher branch ends at questions or internal marks. An admin branch ends at the teacher list. All three can still open Predict. The diagram draws the role split, not every menu link.

